      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AIRCLASH (1) closed off strongly last start to get up for third, beaten just under a length over 1000m in a stronger race than this at Bendigo when resuming after a break. Is twice a second-up winner in the past, so looks right in this. WIND DREAMER (4) was prominent on straightening and stuck on well to finish second last start over 1009m at Yarra Valley, beaten 3/4 of a length. Suitably placed so anticipating another big run. GRUMPYOLDCOL (6) has not won for a long while. Last raced on October 17 when beaten 3 lengths into fourth at Avoca over 1200m after being in the firing line on the corner. Looks a likely improver in this company. DERELICT (2) has a tricky barrier to overcome, but will find this much easier than the first up run and he's placed at 2 of 5 second-up runs. MINESITE (3) is yet to find the frame in two runs since resuming from a spell, but has a strong record at the third run in and looks set to find best form.",
